            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Установи <code>maxLives</code> на <code>12</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxLives = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(maxLives);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>"
